{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/304761-playing-cards-with-demons","id":304761,"title":"Playing cards with Demons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-06T11:31:21-08:00","id":304761,"title":"Playing cards with Demons","content":"Hey there, I'm sure you all have heard of the old trope of a mortal playing cards or rolling dice, etc. with a demon for their soul. Well, I was wondering if there was something in Demon the descent which could play into that mechanic. <br /> <br /> That a demon could enter a sort of &quot;gambling pact&quot; where they could actually play for pieces of a cover, or a mortal's soul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T12:09:05-08:00","id":304860,"title":"","content":"All I know for sure is fiddle contests may seem like a good deal but are in fact fraught with peril for the Demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T12:17:52-08:00","id":304871,"title":"","content":"You know, I originally thought this was going to be about playing cards using the different Agenda symbols as Suits (so you have Inquisitor, Integrator, Saboteurs, and Tempters instead of Clubs, Diamonds, Spades, and Hearts)... but this works too.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Gambling Pacts</span></b><br /> They say the Devil is in the cards - while that might not be true, some Demons have figured out a way to create so-called &quot;gambling pacts&quot;, where the two (or more!) players play for <i>real</i> stakes.<br /> <br /> Each player first places the Ante in the Pot - the Ante is worth an agreed-on number of dots, and then both players play the game - Demons tend to prefer poker. Whoever wins the game wins the Ante; they only get whatever aspects of the Pact they could have gotten normally (so a Mortal cannot steal a Demon's soul, and a Demon couldn't give themselves Merits through this kind of gamble.) After the game, a rapidly jotted IOU with regards to the winnings appears on the table; this constitutes the written portion of the Pact.<br /> <br /> The main advantage of this form of Pact making is that it allows Demons to make &quot;unbalanced&quot; Pacts without having to pay the surcharge; after all, the Pot is perfectly even.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T15:45:56-08:00","id":305074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/304761-playing-cards-with-demons?p=304871#post304871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-i